TECHNICAL ATTRIBUTION
=============================================================================

The following proprietary innovations are the original work of Umar Farooque:

  • 3-Tier Hybrid AI Threat Engine
      Tier 1: SafeSignal Local Heuristics Engine (India-specific fraud rules)
      Tier 2: LLM Orchestrator with circuit-breaker pattern
      Tier 3: Domain-Expert AI Persona Engine (WebGuard, NetShield, etc.)

  • India-Specific Rule Matrix (IN-TRAI-2026)
      TRAI DLT header analysis, UPI payment scam detection, digital arrest
      script identification, electricity bill scam regex patterns,
      OTP theft detection, APK dropper payload analysis.

  • SafeSignal Threat Intelligence Gateway
      Unified API abstraction layer routing all threat intel through
      a proprietary gateway with retry, timeout, and normalization.

  • Native Kotlin Shield Layer
      SmsReceiver, CallReceiver, LinkShieldAccessibilityService,
      EmailNotificationService — all original Kotlin implementations.

  • Incident Response Engine
      FIR document generator, bank account freeze directory, cybercrime
      reporting portal navigator.

